<p>2 countries in two days;  At this rate, if I travel for a year we will have visited 365 countries.   We're in New Jersey visiting Jon's family at the moment and should be heading into Brooklyn later this evening.</p>

<p>Apparently there is some drama with the NYC Subways, CNN knows a lot more than I do:  <a href="http://www.cnn.com/2005/US/10/07/newyork.subways/index.html">New York spends day on alert after false alarm</a>.</p>

<p>Also, I just found out that The Sudbury Star has a front page story about our trip.  I haven't seen it for myself but, if the rumors are true than it could mean a boost to our readership.   A quick search online indicates that they have an average daily <a href="http://www.micromedia.ca/Products_Services/CdnNewsstandDailies_0404.htm">readership</a> of 19,000.  These are exciting times for me.</p>



